    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> is a 2D automation and strategy game set in a world where humanity has rendered the planet uninhabitable. You are the last remaining person, tasked with restoring nature and rebuilding life from a single surviving seed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere is poisoned, resources are scarce, and the environment is hostile. Your mission is to establish production chains, reclaim the ecosystem, and make the world livable again. But not everything in nature welcomes your intervention \u2014 some creatures will see your efforts as a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and process resources to build automated systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create evolving production lines to optimize efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage humidity, temperature, and environmental conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies to sustain life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face resistance from a changing and reactive ecosystem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> blends strategy, exploration, and environmental storytelling into an atmospheric gameplay experience. Every decision you make could shape the fate of a dying world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> is a 2D automation and strategy game set in a world where humanity has rendered the planet uninhabitable. You are the last remaining person, tasked with restoring nature and rebuilding life from a single surviving seed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere is poisoned, resources are scarce, and the environment is hostile. Your mission is to establish production chains, reclaim the ecosystem, and make the world livable again. But not everything in nature welcomes your intervention \u2014 some creatures will see your efforts as a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and process resources to build automated systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create evolving production lines to optimize efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage humidity, temperature, and environmental conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies to sustain life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face resistance from a changing and reactive ecosystem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Seed</strong> blends strategy, exploration, and environmental storytelling into an atmospheric gameplay experience. Every decision you make could shape the fate of a dying world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Restore life on a dying planet in this 2D automation strategy game. Build production chains, reclaim the ecosystem, and survive a hostile world with the help of The Last Seed.",
